      "entries": [
        "Each creature within 80 feet who can hear the owlbear's screech must attempt a DC 20 Will save. The creatures can't be affected by another screech for 1 minute. On a critical success, the creature is unaffected; on a success, the creature gains the frightened 1 condition; on a failure, the creature gains the frightened 2 condition; on a critical failure, the creature gains the frightened 3 condition and must spend its next turn running away from the owlbear."
